sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant L as worker L: local create of doc d
    participant P as worker P: P2P merge brings doc d
    participant R as regolith

    L->>R: put blocks: ContentAddressed, never conflicts
    P->>R: put the same blocks: identical, never conflicts
    L->>R: read DocID mapping for d: absent, validated
    P->>R: read DocID mapping for d: absent, validated
    L->>R: write the mapping, the value, append(journal, d, once key d)
    P->>R: write the mapping, operands, append(journal, d, once key d)
    L->>R: commit
    R-->>L: committed: d gets journal position 57
    P->>R: commit
    Note over R: the mapping read is now stale: exactly one materializes d
    R-->>P: Conflict: mine Read, theirs Put on the DocID mapping
    P->>R: transact re-runs: d exists, apply the remote blocks as operands only
    R-->>P: committed: the once key holds 57, so no second journal row
